# Scrape credentials live here at runtime and are never committed.
#
# Prometheus reads the bearer token for the control plane's metrics endpoint
# from this directory at scrape time rather than from prometheus.yml, because
# a token inlined in the config is served back verbatim by Prometheus's own
# /api/v1/status/config to anyone who reaches the web UI.
#
# Provision the files here from the secret store (Ansible: monitoring role):
#   control-plane-metrics-token   <- PROMETHEUS_METRICS_TOKEN in the app's .env
*
!.gitignore
